## 1. BUSINESS MODEL — NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENTS

Our customers pay a one-time platform fee to obtain their own affiliate store.

There is no monthly platform subscription.

We provide assistance setting up an eligible free-tier database for the customer.

PRODUCT CAPACITY RULE:

Product capacity must NOT depend on the customer's selected pricing plan.

Do not assign artificial restrictions such as:
- Starter: 100 products
- Creator: 1,000 products
- Premium: 10,000 products

These restrictions are no longer part of our offering.

Instead, product capacity depends on the customer's selected database and infrastructure resources.

A Starter customer with sufficient database capacity should be able to manage thousands of products, just like a Premium customer.

Customers may select a compatible database option or use an eligible free-tier database that our team helps them configure.

Database provider limits, API rate limits, storage capacity, compute resources and hosting limits still apply.

Do not advertise unlimited free storage or unlimited hosting.

SUPPORT RULE:

All three plans include access to our 24×7 support team for technical issues and assistance with future upgrades.

Premium customers may receive priority handling and advanced design consultation.

Do not invent contractual response-time guarantees.

Do not assume every future upgrade or redesign is free. Where changes require paid services, communicate the scope and obtain customer approval before charging.

